00:24:55.073 --> 00:24:57.450
VHS won out and that's what the stores had.


00:24:57.784 --> 00:25:00.578
There was a certain magic to the VHS tape.


00:25:00.912 --> 00:25:05.417
I remember the first one we rented was A
